 Account diagnostics JSON includes app version, time, browser, language, theme, connectivity, entry count, count of entries with photos, pending-operation/conflict counts, PIN/lock status, and storage estimates. `entriesWithImageCount` counts each entry with at least one legacy `image` or current `images[]` photo once, not the total number of photos. Entry-derived counts are zero while the vault is locked. It excludes entry text, photos, recovery codes, and keys. Metadata can still help identify someone: inspect it before sharing.
